Third-party content that ships inside the Hejmo binary or its web interface:

GeoNames place list (data, CC BY 4.0, embedded in the binary)
  internal/places/data/places.tsv.gz
  Contains data from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), licensed CC BY 4.0,
  extract of 2026-11-15, filtered to DE/AT/CH and reformatted.
  Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Attribution file: internal/places/data/LICENSE-GeoNames.txt
  Also named on the licences page of the web interface (Settings -> Licences).

Figtree typeface (font, SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  web/static/fonts/Figtree-wght.ttf, licence: web/static/fonts/OFL.txt

nyaruka/phonenumbers (Go library, MIT, linked into the Hejmo binary)
  Go port of Google's libphonenumber by Nyaruka; its number plans are Google's libphonenumber metadata
  (Apache License 2.0). Reads, checks and normalises phone numbers (ADR 0026). No network connections.
  Licence: https://github.com/nyaruka/phonenumbers/blob/master/LICENSE
  Also named on the licences page of the web interface (Settings -> Licences).
